        // Beds (D574), the bed's foot at 20, -60, 20 and its head east of it, a straw bed's two
        // south: one used by day, which sets the spawn and won't let the bot sleep; then by night,
        // under a block and from too far; slept in, used again, which it's in, and left; slept in
        // with Mate spectating, so the night passes once the bot has slept 100 ticks; slept in till
        // the time's set to day, which wakes it, and till it's teleported; the straw bed slept in
        // and left, which it goes as; and the bed used with a creeper by it, last, as Calcite can't
        // select it to kill it yet.
        ("gamemode survival", "bed-survival"),
        ("tp @s 18.5 -60 20.5", "bed-tp"),
        ("setblock 20 -60 20 red_bed[facing=east,part=foot]", "bed-foot"),
        ("setblock 21 -60 20 red_bed[facing=east,part=head]", "bed-head"),
        ("time set day", "bed-day"),
        ("#use-bed", "bed-use-day"),
