        ("#use-straw", "straw-sleep"),
        ("#leave-bed", "straw-leave"),
        // Respawning (D576): at the bed, its spawn set by day; then `spawnpoint` where the bot is,
        // for both players, out of bounds, for no one, and turned, and a respawn at the place it
