        ("", "nether-waiting-4"),
        ("", "portal-back"),
        // Ender pearls (D579): five in the bot's hand away from the portal; one thrown down, which
        // takes it where it was thrown from, and another in the same tick, on its cooldown, so not
        // thrown; one far to the north-west, which takes it there as it lands; then, in creative
