// clock, `saveChunksEagerly`. Then it goes through gateways set in the grass north-east (D593),
// each time put by it and left a step first, so the chunks about it are all sent, as vanilla's
// load slower and a gateway takes it on before they are: one with its exit exact at 20, -60, 20,
